  "description": "On his lonely birthday, he makes a wish on an old family talisman — *“Please let me meet someone I can love.”*\n\nMoments later, a man appears at his door, holding a cake.\n\n*“Don’t fall for me. That feeling… it’s fake. The charm made it.”  \n“You made the wish. So now, you’re responsible for it.”*\n\nA fateful meeting bound by a charm... but is their love really just magic, or something real that bloomed in its wake?\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: RIDI ([R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/2553001117), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/2553001123)), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000131309), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=924037769), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11659972)  \nChapters: RIDI ([R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/2553000730), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/2553000790))\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5265000461), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13739282), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Silent_Wish), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/silent_wish), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000075918), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260178), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68901816) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/bl-gl/silent-wish/list?title_no=10904)",
